The '''Ice Queen's Lair''' is a dungeon located under the [[White Wolf Mountain]]. The entrance is blocked by a [[rock slide]] requiring a [[pickaxe]] and level 50 [[Mining]] to remove. The rock slide can not be mined by another player. The lair plays a major role in [[Heroes' Quest]], where players must kill the [[Ice Queen]] to obtain [[ice gloves]]. Player can get there quickly via the [[Gnome glider|gnome glider]].

If a player loses their ice gloves, they may acquire a new pair by slaying the queen again, but because the dungeon is out of the way, it's recommended to get multiple pairs during the quest.

==Reaching the Ice Queen==
The Ice Queen can be found at the end of a small maze, with [[ice warrior]]s and [[Ice spider|spiders]] throughout. To enter, head toward the northern tip of [[White Wolf Mountain]]. You will need to mine the rock slide to the north-west of the gnome glider to enter.

;Steps
#After the rock slide, head '''down''' the '''southernmost''' ladder
#Go down the '''south-west''' tunnel and climb '''up''' the ladder at the end
#Avoiding the [[Ice giant|ice giants]], climb down the '''easternmost''' ladder
#Go '''north''' through the long tunnel, and climb '''up''' the ladder at the end
#Climb '''down''' the ladder immediately next to it
#Follow the tunnel '''north''' until it opens into a large room

